sequenceDiagram
    actor Recipient
    participant Browser
    participant Worker as Postcard Worker
    participant Analytics as Aggregate analytics
    participant Site as packaroo.app
    participant Store as App Store
    Recipient->>Browser: Open postcard link
    Browser->>Worker: Request card
    alt Missing or expired
        Worker-->>Browser: Unavailable page
    else Valid postcard
        Worker-->>Browser: Interactive card, stamp, attribution, and badge
        Browser->>Browser: Wait until page is visible
        Browser-->>Worker: recipient_page_opened, once per page load
        Worker-->>Analytics: Aggregate event
        Note over Recipient,Browser: Flip and save images without subscription or installation
        opt Select header app icon
            Browser-->>Worker: packaroo_icon_clicked
            Worker-->>Analytics: Aggregate event
            Browser->>Site: Open in a new tab
        end
        opt Select App Store badge
            Browser-->>Worker: app_store_badge_clicked
            Worker-->>Analytics: Aggregate event
            Browser->>Store: Open listing in a new tab
        end
    end
    Note over Browser,Analytics: No card token, URL, content, cookies, or identity in events
    Note over Browser,Store: Click counts do not prove an install or subscription
